{"title":"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/76740cce82ebcb9066d07e5b9b7ea1a6c96a8a03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" /> is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/46878f7c8f14d405df28c4052df9e7f68104fe0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^3 + bx^2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/2855a148f1545c04c820d1162b692d5a7ebda352.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -1\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 0\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"17\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using polynomial division, we find that the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95af8de07f547b4ffc2e88cd5b03ba093291f8cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a+b)x+(a+b+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"18\" />, so for the condition to hold, we need this remainder to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a1ff87ac236f5f308764590d228ea7edf8d028.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc6a12da5a40cad6ee5a18231bcd4b18a29c126c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1acc91167f0a4017dcca2acfd7ff5c7e9f56ea6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-2a$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/5/4455efa75ed6aafd44f6b365392d1e09d751f259.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-2a+1=0 \\implies a=1 \\implies b=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"311\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/7/847c1813e01d09bbac28e602c750db6cc3178850.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{A}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aJtWZzUL-6E\">https://youtu.be/aJtWZzUL-6E</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME\" title=\"1988 AHSME\">1988 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> 